{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Selene 是一款為輪班及排班不固定工作者而設的班表日曆，主打無廣告、無內購、無須註冊，並已內置全部 30 款主題。它把班次編排、鬧鐘、統計與分享功能整合於同一個日曆之中，適合醫護、保安、零售、物流等需要輪班的從業人員，亦方便需要與家人或同事對照班表的用家。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，於 App Store 可供下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-196.webp\">\n<h2>輪班鬧鐘與班表分享</h2>\n<p>可為每種班次設定鬧鐘，系統會按班表自動編排響鬧，主畫面小工具讓你直接查看接下來的班次與事件。你可加入多個日曆比較彼此班表，查看班次統計，並把班表分享或匯出為 PDF、圖片與 CSV。App 內置 30 款主題，支援 iCloud 同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-229-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-230-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-231-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-232-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-233-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-234-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Selene: Shift Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T20:38:38.315890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T20:28:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T00:28:28.069642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T20:37:34.007563+00:00","content_hash":"317af81d1615c1a3c62b5d024f0ba7cca53d5a23fee98fb2432dd60004adbfda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}